---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { newsletterUrl } from '../lib/config';
---
<Layout title="Stay connected"><PageIntro eyebrow="A little hope in your inbox" title="Good things are growing." description="Stay close to the ideas, community-led projects, and practical possibilities behind a more abundant Earth." /><section class="section container two-column"><div class="prose"><h2>Stories that connect us.</h2><p>AEF’s newsletter has been a way to share project stories and connect supporters with the work. Ask to hear about future updates and opportunities to take part.</p><ul><li>People and projects from the grassroots network.</li><li>Regenerative growing and learning opportunities.</li><li>Ways to support and participate.</li></ul><p>Your interest in updates should always be your choice. A giving inquiry or a project inquiry does not subscribe you to a mailing list.</p><a class="text-link" href="/stories/">Explore stories from the archive <Icon /></a></div>{newsletterUrl ? <div class="form-card"><p class="eyebrow">Stay in the loop</p><h2>Join the newsletter.</h2><p>Continue to AEF’s verified signup provider to enter your email and confirm your subscription. Subscription status is managed by that provider.</p><a class="button" href={newsletterUrl}>Go to newsletter signup <Icon /></a><p class="form-help" style="margin-top:20px">Review the provider’s privacy information and any confirmation email before subscribing.</p></div> : <div><div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:25px"><strong>Newsletter signup is awaiting connection.</strong>This preview does not collect subscribers. You can prepare an email asking the team how to join the list.</div><InquiryForm topic="Newsletter" compact /></div>}</section></Layout>
